      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "297. 设函数由公式$y=4x^2-5x+7$给出，使这个函数取等于",
        "下列各值的$x$值存在吗(在肯定回答的情况下，指出$x$",
        "的值)？",
        "а) 3；　б) 6."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "19. 等比数列前$n$项的和的公式"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设$(b_n)$是等比数列. 我们写出这个数列的前$n$项：",
        "$b_1$，$b_2$，$b_3$，…，$b_{n-1}$，$b_n$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们用$S_n$表示前$n$项的和：",
        "$S_n=b_1+b_2+b_3+\\cdots+b_{n-1}+b_n$.　(1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果$q=1$，那么数列所有的项都等于$b_1$，而$S_n=nb_1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来看$q\\ne1$的情形."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "将等式(1)的两边乘以$q$，得到：",
        "$qS_n=b_1q+b_2q+b_3q+\\cdots+b_{n-1}q+b_nq$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "但$b_1q=b_2$，$b_2q=b_3$，$b_3q=b_4$，…，$b_{n-1}q=b_n$，因此",
        "$qS_n=b_2+b_3+b_4+\\cdots+b_n+b_nq$.　(2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从等式(2)逐项减去等式(1)，得到：",
        "$qS_n-S_n=b_nq-b_1$，",
        "$S_n(q-1)=b_nq-b_1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为$q\\ne1$，所以",
        "$S_n=\\frac{b_nq-b_1}{q-1}$.　(I)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例　求下列等比数列$(b_n)$前10项的和：",
        "1，2，4，8，…."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "数列的第1项等于1，而公比等于2. 求出这个数列的第"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
